  "solution": "Given:\n\n65 – [40 – (60 ÷ 5 – (18 – 24 ÷ 4) ÷ 6)]\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5150c5b90ff0d3fbdd6a542cbd6ec09a59c26abaae848bd31e3bf0035c4d0714.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n65 – [40 – (60 ÷ 5 – (18 – 24 ÷ 4) ÷ 6)]\n\n⇒ 65 – [40 – (60 ÷ 5 – (18 – 6) ÷ 6)]\n\n⇒ 65 – [40 – (60 ÷ 5 – 12 ÷ 6)]\n\n⇒ 65 – [40 – (12 – 2)]\n\n⇒ 65 – [40 – 10]\n\n⇒ 65 - 30\n\n⇒ 35\n\n**∴ The simplified value of 65 – [40 – (60 ÷ 5 – (18 – 24 ÷ 4) ÷ 6)] is 35.**",
